      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>The Pulse — Article</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\">The <strong>Pulse</strong></a>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <ul class=\"nav\">\n          <li><a href=\"#tech\">Tech</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#culture\">Culture</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#opinion\">Opinion</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <article class=\"article container\">\n      <header class=\"article-meta\">\n        <h1 class=\"article-title\">Student projects are getting smarter</h1>\n        <p class=\"byline\">By <a href=\"#author\">Ari Johnson</a> • March 8, 2025</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <figure class=\"hero-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/mag/1200/680\" alt=\"Students collaborating on laptops\" />\n        <figcaption>Robotics, media arts, and coding clubs are teaming up.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>Across schools this year, clubs are sharing resources and tools to ship bigger ideas. From organizing makerspaces to publishing digital magazines, teams are discovering new ways to collaborate.</p>\n\n        <h2 class=\"section-head\">Less chaos, more flow</h2>\n        <p>Groups that once kept notes in five places are moving to shared hubs. It’s easier to see what’s next and who needs help.</p>\n        <p>When teammates can follow a single plan, they spend less time searching and more time building.</p>\n\n        <blockquote>\n          “We finished a week early once we kept tasks, files, and chat in one place.”\n        </blockquote>\n\n        <h3 class=\"subhead\">What students are trying</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Checklists for weekly builds</li>\n          <li>Templates for project plans</li>\n          <li>Short retros to reduce blockers</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p>Want to see more examples? Visit our <a href=\"#guide\">guide</a> for stories and starter kits collected from clubs around the district.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <aside class=\"related\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-head\">Related reading</h2>\n        <ul class=\"related-list\">\n          <li><a href=\"#1\">How to run a 20-minute retrospective</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#2\">Designing for accessibility from day one</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#3\">Publishing your club’s digital zine</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </aside>\n    </article>\n\n    <footer class=\"site-footer container\">\n      <p>© 2025 The Pulse Magazine</p>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "styles.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Make hierarchy + readability better. */\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  background: #f6f7fb;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n}\n\na {\n  color: #2563eb;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\nh1,\nh2,\nh3 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n}\n\n.skip-link {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -9999px;\n  top: auto;\n}\n\n.skip-link:focus {\n  left: 16px;\n  top: 16px;\n  background: black;\n  color: white;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: 1000px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  background: white;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n}\n\n.header-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 0;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  text-decoration: none;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.nav {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  list-style: none;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.nav a {\n  color: #1f2937;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n/* Typography still needs work:\n   - body text is a little tight\n   - heading sizes are too similar\n   - line lengths are too long\n   - links, quotes, lists, and captions need stronger emphasis */\n\n.article {\n  padding: 20px 0 30px;\n}\n\n.article-title {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: none;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.byline {\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.hero-media {\n  margin: 12px 0 16px;\n}\n\n.hero-media img {\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.hero-media figcaption {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.content {\n}\n\n.section-head {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  margin: 16px 0 8px;\n}\n\n.subhead {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  margin: 12px 0 6px;\n}\n\nblockquote {\n  margin: 12px 0;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  border-left: 3px solid #cbd5e1;\n  color: #374151;\n}\n\nul {\n  margin: 8px 0 12px 18px;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nul li {\n  margin: 6px 0;\n}\n\n.related {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  padding-top: 14px;\n}\n\n.related-list {\n  margin: 8px 0 0 16px;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.related-list a {\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  padding: 16px 0;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n  .container {\n    width: 92%;\n  }\n}",
